@@ -2,6 +2,10 @@
 
 Repository-oriented source for building Windows Manager gate archives. It belongs under `keelaryn/tests/framework/manager-gate`; it is not production Manager state and is not Hub source.
 
+## Framework revision 10
+
+Revision 10 bounds command-log and exit-code sidecar filenames. The visible command label is unchanged, while the filesystem prefix uses the first 80 sanitized label characters plus a deterministic 12-hex SHA-256 suffix of the complete label. This prevents long command arguments from exceeding Windows path limits without weakening process exit-code capture or command-log uniqueness.
+
 ## Goals
 
 - one reusable gate harness instead of version-specific copies;
